  "visible_text": "Kit & gear\nWho we are\nBag\nHalden Pour-Over Set 02\n\nA ceramic dripper, glass carafe and a box of filters, sized for one to two cups.\n\nBuilt in small batches at our Lviv workshop. Each unit is checked by hand before it leaves the bench, and the glaze differs slightly from piece to piece.\n\nCare: rinse with warm water. Avoid abrupt temperature change.\n\nWhat is in the box\n\nThe set, a cloth pouch, and a card with our brewing notes.\n\nReserve this one\n\nHalden Hearth Roasting Co. · Lviv · hello@haldenhearth.example\nMore",
